desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Json Entity Escape"
	title_zh: "Json Entity Escape"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-json-entity-escape"
	risk: "xss"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Checks if HTML escaping is globally disabled for JSON output. This could lead to XSS.

### 风险类型
跨站脚本（XSS）（xss）

### 影响
未正确转义或过滤用户输入，攻击者可在页面中注入并执行恶意脚本。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-79: Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation ('Cross-site Scripting')
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
对输出进行上下文相关的转义，使用安全的模板 API，并启用 CSP 等防护。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.rb": <<<POS
ActiveSupport.escape_html_entities_in_json = false
POS
	"safefile://pos.rb": <<<NEG
ActiveSupport.escape_html_entities_in_json = true
NEG
)

${*.rb}.pattern_regex(/(?:ActiveSupport\.escape_html_entities_in_json\s+=\s+false)|(?:config\.active_support\.escape_html_entities_in_json\s+=\s+false)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Json Entity Escape",
	title_zh: "Json Entity Escape",
	message: "Json Entity Escape detected.",
}
